# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
# Generic Android policy owns input, sound, DRM, and block nodes. Darwin UML
# adds its host serial and single-port Virtio console permissions, and the
# group of the video encoder's V4L2 nodes: the Codec2 service joins camera, as
# a product that follows Cuttlefish owns the video nodes that way.
/dev/ttyS0 0660 root shell
/dev/hvc0 0660 root shell
/dev/video* 0660 system camera
